        "digitization_method": "ADDED 2026-09-19 after the owner flagged missing coverage in this area on review, prompting a closer satellite-imagery check that the prior block-by-block pass had not actually done for every block despite its own description: MB360, a residential complex marketed under one name but built as two separated volumes -- 701 China Basin St (already tracked as 'MB360', mission_bay_mb360.geojson) and this one at 1200 4th St, ~180m apart. Both addresses are used interchangeably for 'MB360' across apartment-listing sites (apartments.com uses 701 China Basin St; Trulia/Redfin/Zillow use 1200 4th St), consistent with one development having two street-facing volumes rather than being two different buildings.",
        "accuracy_caveat": "REAL -- surveyed DataSF Building Footprints outline (mblr SF8711017), address confirmed via DataSF Assessor parcel data and apartment-listing sources; not a hand trace or plan estimate. Trimmed against the adjacent Mission Bay Kids' Park to remove a 69 sq m overlap.",
